5,0,1,talk,Servas,,"Greetings, everyone. Let us begin this journey with open minds and clear hearts.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Mizuki,,Good morning. I hope we can all work together to find the truth and keep the village safe.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Mizuki"",""self"":true,""raw"":""**Mizuki**: Good morning. I hope we can all work together to find the truth and keep the village safe.""}]}"
7,0,1,talk,Sakura,,Hi everyone! I’m so excited to start! Let’s have fun and figure out who the bad guys are!,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Midori,,"Hello everyone. I’m a bit nervous, but I’ll do my best to listen carefully and help us find the truth.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Midori"",""self"":true,""raw"":""**Midori**: Hello everyone. I’m a bit nervous, but I’ll do my best to listen carefully and help us find the truth.""}]}"
9,0,1,talk,Ryuji,,I will observe the dynamics closely. Let us proceed with caution and logic.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Servas,,Wisdom lies in patience. Let us listen to the whispers of the night before we judge.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Servas"",""self"":true,""raw"":""**Servas**: Wisdom lies in patience. Let us listen to the whispers of the night before we judge.""}]}"
11,0,2,talk,Mizuki,,I agree with Servas. Patience is key. Let us not rush to conclusions before the night reveals its secrets.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Sakura,,"I’m not sure what “whispers of the night” means, but I’m ready to help! Who should we watch closely today?","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Midori,,I think we should all share our first impressions. Who feels the most out of place to you?,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Ryuji,,I have no strong impressions yet. Let us wait for the night to pass before forming any judgments.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Servas,,"Midori, your intuition is sound. Let us trust the process and remain united in our vigilance.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Mizuki,,I agree. We must remain calm and observe. Let us not let suspicion divide us before we have any real evidence to rely on.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Sakura,,I think we should all be nice to each other! Maybe we can share snacks later?,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Midori,,I’d love that! Sharing food always brings people closer. Let’s keep our spirits high while we watch for any odd behavior.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Ryuji,,"I appreciate the sentiment, but let us focus on the task at hand. We need to identify the threat, not just socialize.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Servas,,"Ryuji, caution is wise, but unity is our shield. Let us rest now, for the night holds the answers we seek.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Mizuki,,"I agree. Rest well, everyone. We must be sharp and ready for tomorrow’s revelations.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,0,4,talk,Sakura,,"Okay! I’ll try to sleep, but I’m still super excited. Goodnight everyone!","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,0,4,talk,Midori,,"Goodnight, everyone. I hope we all sleep well and wake up with clear minds for tomorrow.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,0,4,talk,Ryuji,,"Goodnight. I will rest, but my mind remains active. We will see what the night brings.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
